  "allOf":[{"if":{"properties":{"status":{"const":"accepted"}}},"then":{"required":["schemaVersion","status","package","vm","steps","evidence","privacy","credentials","approval"],"properties":{"package":{"properties":{"fileName":{"pattern":"^(?!latest\\.zip$)[^\\\\/:*?\"<>|]+\\.zip$"},"sha256":{"pattern":"^[A-Fa-f0-9]{64}$"},"xqVersion":{"minLength":1},"upstreamVersion":{"minLength":1}}},"vm":{"properties":{"os":{"const":"Windows 11"},"architecture":{"const":"x64"},"cleanSnapshot":{"const":true},"tester":{"minLength":1},"completedAtUtc":{"format":"date-time"}}},"steps":{"minItems":12,"maxItems":12,"items":{"properties":{"result":{"const":"passed"},"evidenceRef":{"minLength":1}}}},"evidence":{"properties":{"screenshots":{"minItems":5},"recording":{"minLength":1},"diagnosticReport":{"minLength":1},"defenderScan":{"minLength":1},"uninstallCheck":{"minLength":1},"secretScan":{"const":"passed"}}},"privacy":{"properties":{"reviewed":{"const":true}}},"credentials":{"properties":{"testKeyRevoked":{"const":true},"revokedAtUtc":{"format":"date-time"}}},"approval":{"properties":{"approvedBy":{"minLength":1},"approvedAtUtc":{"format":"date-time"}}}}}}]
